====

Input vs Output Artifacts

| Artifact Type      | Example in your project | Purpose                            |
| ------------------ | ----------------------- | ---------------------------------- |
| **Input Artifact** | `insurance_pre.csv`     | Used to train the model            |
| **Source Code**    | `train.py`              | Contains ML training instructions  |
| **Model Artifact** | `model.joblib`          | Your trained Random Forest model   |
| **Packaged Model** | `model.tar.gz`          | Model package created by SageMaker |
| **Output/Logs**    | R² score, output files  | Training results and information   |


